        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: मध्ये",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मध्ये — madhye — \"in the middle\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "madhye is the locative, \"in the middle\", of madhya \"middle\" (MW). MW sets madhya beside Latin medius, Greek mesos and English mid: one inherited Indo-European word. This very locative wore down into Hindi meṁ \"in\" (CDIAL 9804)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
