              "text": "sarvatra is built from sarva \"all\" and the place ending -tra \"in, at\" (MW). MW compares sarva with Greek holos \"whole\" and Latin salvus \"safe\". Pali wore sarvatra down to sabbattha (CDIAL 13278), and sarva itself became Hindi sab \"all\" (CDIAL 13276)."
